<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HNC Software cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HNC Software cut on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley analyst David Togut downgraded HNC Software Inc to neutral from outperform due to the stock's valuation, his office said.</p>
<p>-- the shares had risen above the analyst's $38 price target.</p>
<p>-- it was off one at 41.</p>
</text>
